        "title": "Provision of Methodological Research Services",
        "description": "The key objective of this Contract is to strengthen the capacity of the Contracting Authority by exploiting the best statistical methods for official statistics and to improve the integrity of statistical outputs and the skills of its staff.   \r\n\r\nThe Supplier must be able to: \r\n\r\nProvide high-quality advice and training on statistical methods and analysis. \r\n\r\nTake part in joint methodological research projects, reviews and quality assessments. \r\n\r\nFill the gaps in statistical knowledge and experience within the Contracting Authority and to promote the transfer of knowledge.  \r\n\r\nUndertake commissioned statistical work and provide written technical reports and code as agreed.",
